=== POST-REDACTION NOTE ===
Reviewer correctly distinguished that the live RED here is at the HOST's sandbox
layer (Chromium --enable-sandbox on the VSCodium Helper (Plugin) parent that
hosts PID 25108 = this extension host), NOT at the ClineMM Seatbelt profile
layer. The ClineMM profile is never even applied in this substrate
(sandbox-exec returns `sandbox_apply: Operation not permitted`). See
ACT body §"Root cause analysis" / §"Why `target same-sandbox` would not help".
